From dee9829c63c8a947fec11fa08cc7abe4d6a668aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nakya <nakya@Mac-mini-di-Nakya.local>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:31:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat: office-watch streams the tool each Bot is using, or
 its own status line

Reads currentActivity on Bot-list rows (Grok Bot 0.78.1): tool names map to
browser, shell, file or editor; Bots that write their own status line
(SetStatus) only expose that text, so it is passed on as status.

- office-watch: one JSON line per Bot on start, then one per change
- bots --json adds tool, toolName and status
- internals adds toolSteps (unknown while no Bot is working)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
